Linux kernel userspace API header

The file ref/g_uvc.h is the Linux kernel's USB Video Class gadget userspace API
header. It is carried in this repository unmodified for reference only. It was
taken from the Luckfox Pico SDK's kernel tree, at
sysdrv/source/kernel/include/uapi/linux/usb/g_uvc.h (Linux 5.10.160), and is
byte-identical to that copy.

It is licensed GPL-2.0+ WITH Linux-syscall-note. That exception exists so that
userspace programs using kernel API headers are not themselves made subject to
the GPL. The daemon in any case includes <linux/usb/g_uvc.h> from the toolchain
sysroot rather than from ref/, so this copy is part of no build.

Copyright (C) 2009-2010 Laurent Pinchart

