Rockchip SDK libraries and services (not redistributed)

The uvc_streamer daemon links against librockit, librockchip_mpp, and librga,
and runs alongside the closed-source rkaiq_3A_server. These components ship
with the Luckfox Pico vendor SDK and board image. They are not redistributed
by this project. Their licensing terms are defined by Rockchip.
